        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "The action is unavoidable",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Repeating both the positive and negative alternative insists that the action is required either way. The modal is pronounced with the must reading; this can sound forceful.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "去也得去，不去也得去。",
                "pinyin": "qù yě děi qù ， bù qù yě děi qù 。",
                "meaning": "You have to go, whether you want to or not.",
                "audio": "74685bc86ada66bc08b9e550db6f2e69d5f028afc1c1764aac7ea62528ce8891"
              }
            ]
          },
